      "source": "Determine the order for this factory's aspect instance,\neither an instance-specific order expressed through implementing\nthe <a href=\"../../core/Ordered.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a> interface,\nor a fallback order.",
      "translation": "确定此工厂的 Aspect 实例的顺序，即通过实现<a href=\"../../core/Ordered.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a>接口表达的特定于实例的顺序，或回退顺序。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation simply returns <code>Ordered.LOWEST_PRECEDENCE</code>.",
      "translation": "默认实现仅返回<code>Ordered.LOWEST_PRECEDENCE</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementation of <a href=\"AspectInstanceFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aop.aspectj\"><code>AspectInstanceFactory</code></a> that creates a new instance\nof the specified aspect class for every <a href=\"#getAspectInstance()\"><code>getAspectInstance()</code></a> call.",
